WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.501
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.000
This is "Late Night." We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.767
Now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:07.767
Politico published an article
yesterday titled

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:10.434
"Biden Won't Directly Address
the Age Issue."

00:00:10.434 --> 00:00:12.300
Well, that's part
of the age issue.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.601
Guys that age don't directly
address anything.

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.434
If you ask your grandpa
what time it is,

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:20.434
he'll say something like,
"Come on out back with me, kid.

00:00:20.434 --> 00:00:22.100
We're gonna make a sundial."

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:26.300
President Biden met today
with a group of CEOs

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.634
to discuss the economy.

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:30.868
"Look, we're all strapped
for cash," they said,

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.701
from space.

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:34.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.834
After federal prosecutions filed
additional counts --

00:00:37.834 --> 00:00:40.434
federal prosecutors filed
additional counts against him,

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:42.567
George Santos told reporters
yesterday, quote,

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:45.734
"I'm pretty much denying
every last bit of charges."

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:47.567
"Pretty much"?

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:48.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.801 --> 00:00:52.300
What kind of defense
is "pretty much"?

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.467
"The defendant's been charged
with armed robbery

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.534
and two counts of murder one.
How do you plead?"

00:00:56.534 --> 00:01:00.434
"Like 95% not guilty,
Your Honor."

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:01.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:05.334
"Like, rounding up,
totally not guilty."

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:07.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.501
During a gathering this week

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.334
of Republican donors
and influencers,

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:12.267
Utah Senator Mitt Romney
said, quote,

00:01:12.267 --> 00:01:15.100
"Our party has
multiple personality disorder."

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.133
Though Romney's trying
to offset that

00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:19.267
by not having one at all.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:20.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:24.534
Russian President Vladimir Putin
traveled today to Kyrgyzstan

00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:26.400
on his first
foreign visit of the year,

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.400
where the leadership
begged Putin to send over

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:31.734
some much needed vowels.

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:34.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:40.200
[ Laughs ]
That's how dialed we are in

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.334
to the geopolitical situations
that are happening.

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:44.934
You know what?
The good news is,

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.601
if Putin watched,

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:49.100
I think
he kind of liked that joke.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:51.267
You know, I bet when Putin
watches the late night shows

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:52.767
right now
and he sees his picture come up,

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:54.601
he's like,
[Russian accent] "Here we go."

00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:56.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.267 --> 00:02:00.100
"Okay, let me guess. They're
gonna dump on old Vlad again."

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.434
[Normal voice] I bet he watched
that one, he was like...

00:02:01.434 --> 00:02:03.267
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:05.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:09.467
[Russian accent]
I just had a good laugh.

00:02:09.467 --> 00:02:11.634
Don't push Ivan out the window.

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:13.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.801
[Normal voice]
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:02:16.801 --> 00:02:18.667
hosted an event
at the White House yesterday

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:20.434
honoring teenage girls
and young women.

00:02:20.434 --> 00:02:21.767
Smart move to plan it

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:24.534
while Matt Gaetz is busy
with the speaker vote.

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:27.434
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:27.434 --> 00:02:30.434
[Russian accent] Well, I don't
like that. Matt is good friend.

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:33.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:35.601
It's about Ivan.
Yes, I've changed my mind.

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:38.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:39.868
[Normal voice]
A teenager in Australia

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:41.367
recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:42.968
after he solved
a Rubik's Cube

00:02:42.968 --> 00:02:45.467
in under 12 seconds
while blindfolded.

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:48.133
Wow! How did he have
such nimble hands?

00:02:48.133 --> 00:02:49.634
Ohh, okay.

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:52.100
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:56.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.968 --> 00:03:00.567
There's a lot of reasons
that joke doesn't work.

00:03:00.567 --> 00:03:02.901
That's why --
That's why I like it.

00:03:02.901 --> 00:03:04.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.901
In a new interview,

00:03:05.901 --> 00:03:08.901
actress Jada Pinkett Smith said
that she and actor Will Smith

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:11.400
have been separated since 2016.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:14.400
And when he heard that,
Chris Rock slapped himself.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:21.601
And finally, according
to a new study,

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:24.400
female frogs may pretend
they are dead

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.000
to avoid mating with male frogs.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.434
Boy, you know the sex is bad

00:03:27.434 --> 00:03:29.934
when you'd rather be dissected
by eighth graders.

00:03:29.934 --> 00:03:31.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.701
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:03:32.701 --> 00:03:35.968
We are off and running,
as they say.

